<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.spirit.trues ~ ah ~ one slot replaced or one line added, base-checked

`lares spirit ah <pet> --slot '#/<name>'` replaces the slot's whole body from one source (`--file <path|->` or `--text <words>`) or adds one line at its end (`--add <line>`). A whole-slot write from an AI seat names the slot digest it read (`--base`, 16 hex); where the slot moved since, both versions land in a marked conflict stanza for hum to settle, and an `--add` re-reads past a conflict so a sibling's line survives. The stack slot `#/has` takes one cap per `--add`. `--instance` names the writer, joins the presence, and refuses during that instance's crossing.

Three other modes ride the verb. `--new` lands a whole shrine from one source. `--offer` lands an offering (ʻālana) on the spirit's shelf before any instance wakes: the mandate words (else the card's own `lane`), `--lane` its memory pointer, `--grant` the grant's slice; a seat names its own `--instance`. `--echo <hash> --instance <id>` lands an instance's echo of the mandate om handed it. Words pass the strict secret-shape guard first.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ add-line · replace · offer · echo

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`add-line` params=`pet/lares-alpha slot/#/open add/[[the next road]] ~ one line lands at the slot's end`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`replace` params=`pet/lares-alpha slot/#/open file/open.txt base/<digest> ~ the slot's whole body, under the digest read`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`offer` params=`pet/ferry-read offer/true file/mandate.md ~ an offering lands on the shelf`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`echo` params=`pet/ferry-read echo/<hash> instance/s-01 ~ the instance echoes the mandate`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet · slot · file · text · add · base · instance · new · offer · lane · grant · echo

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/pet-name needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the spirit's pet name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slot` params=`takes/slot-path ~ the slot to true, #/<name>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path ~ the slot's whole body, or a mandate, from a host file or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`text` params=`takes/words ~ the slot's whole body, or a mandate, as words`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`add` params=`takes/line ~ one line at the slot's end; a cap line on #/has`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`base` params=`takes/digest ~ the slot digest this instance read (16 hex); an AI seat's whole write needs it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`instance` params=`takes/session-id ~ the writing instance; joins the presence`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`new` params=`~ land a whole shrine from one source`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`offer` params=`~ land an offering on the spirit's shelf`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lane` params=`takes/uri ~ beside offer, the lane's memory pointer`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grant` params=`takes/slice ~ beside offer, the grant's slice`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`echo` params=`takes/hash ~ the mandate hash om handed this instance (64 hex)`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/write-on-the-daemon-wiki ~ every write rides the tiddler door's put under its base; a re-offer over a standing mandate lands only from its offerer or a hand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · spirit-pet-malformed · spirit-cap-malformed · spirit-cap-held · spirit-base-needed · spirit-slot-held · spirit-slot-over-budget · spirit-crossing · spirit-face-turned · spirit-unoffered · spirit-echo-mismatch · spirit-offer-held · spirit-offering-damaged · spirit-lane-sealed · spirit-exists · spirit-secret-shaped · spirit-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha slot/#/open add/<line>]] ~ no source, two sources, a malformed slot, base or instance`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-pet-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha slot/#/open add/<line>]] ~ the word reads as no pet name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-cap-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha slot/#/has add/<cap>]] ~ a #/has line names no three-term cap`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-cap-held` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha offer/true file/<mandate>]] ~ the mandate's cap lands by the door's own act alone`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-base-needed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha slot/#/open file/<path> base/<digest>]] ~ an AI seat's whole-slot write names the digest it read`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-slot-held` params=`~ a card answers through its fields; the slot names no card field`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-slot-over-budget` params=`~ the waking slot would grow past its cap; fold first`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-crossing` params=`~ the instance stands between its precompact mark and its next wake`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-face-turned` params=`~ the instance echoed under another face; name it with --face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-unoffered` params=`~ an echo names a mandate the shelf never offered`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-echo-mismatch` params=`~ the echo names another hash than the standing mandate`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-offer-held` params=`~ a re-offer over a standing mandate comes from neither its offerer nor a hand`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-offering-damaged` params=`~ the shelf reads damaged`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-lane-sealed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.trues pet/lares-alpha offer/true file/<mandate>]] ~ the card seals its lane, so a bare offer never copies it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-exists` params=`~ --new meets a shrine already standing`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-secret-shaped` params=`~ the words hold secret-shaped strings; nothing landed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-write-refused` params=`~ the tiddler door answered no put; read the record`>>
```

